          "id": "7c38c89b50df9e41860aa12c3fabeb5a1c81f8fe",
          "message": "Bootloader fix (#2364)\n\nCurrently, our bootloader setup doesn't take into acount the cost of\nrunning the bootloader while setting up the inputs.\nIt may happen, in memory heavy workloads, that too many pages get paged\nin by the bootloader and there is no rows left in the chunk for running\nany computation.\nThis PR takes into account the cost of the bootloader when building its\ninputs.",
