          "id": "b18b3de9364c339c52f50f357614fdfddfe9a995",
          "message": "Make `bus_id` field explicit (#2404)\n\nWe so far assumed that the first entry of the payload of a\n`PhantomBusInteraction` is the bus ID. Now, it has an extra field in the\nannotation. For example, if we decided to fingerprint it differently, we\nwouldn't have to change any (automatic) witgen code.",
