          "message": "Support Not sound challenges in Stwo (#2367)\n\n# Support for NOT Sound Challenges in Stwo\n\n## PR Description\n\nThis PR introduces support for NOT sound challenges in the Stwo prover.\n\n### Changes\n- **Support for proving in two stages**:\n  - Added assertions in `mod.rs` to enforce a maximum of two stages.\n- **Implementation of dummy challenges**:\n  - Added deterministic challenges for testing and validation.\n- The `challenge_channel`, used as a hash function, now generates\ndeterministic values as challenges.\n\n### TODO:\n- [x] Add support for proving with two stages, with validation in\n`mod.rs`.\n- [x] Implement dummy challenges for testing and ensure\n`challenge_channel` provides deterministic output.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Georg Wiese <georgwiese@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Thibaut Schaeffer <schaeffer.thibaut@gmail.com>",
