          "id": "98ffa98917dd0c5496420b266eaebceb62691fee",
          "message": "Compute multiple cell values conditionally from other cell values. (#2434)\n\nI think this is the last part for prover functions, which is needed for\nthe arithmetic machine:\n\nCompute the values of multiple cells at the same time from other known\ncells, but only if a condition is true. The biggest challenge here is\nthat we need to be able to evaluate the condition at compile time.",
