          "id": "01d13c4b62895137d214eb45930533e3bab252db",
          "message": "Bus single interaction update (#2459)\n\nDepends on #2458, which depends on #2457.\n\nInstead of removing the single bus interaction API entirely, I kept it\nas a user friendly choice (so that the user can just provide raw inputs\nin the case of a single bus interaction, instead of providing a vector\nof tuple of inputs). This PR makes the single version call the multi\nversion (and falls to the \"odd\" case) to ensure maximum code reuse and\nbest optimization.",
