          "id": "7f066187febacd893acfb93fcb848f613bb0557a",
          "message": "Bus interaction linker tests (#2484)\n\nDepends on #2483 merged.\n\nCurrently we don't have a machine/submachine test that uses both lookup\nand permutation in order to test our linker. This PR will be similar to\n#2479 but instead of using one block and manually created bus\ninteractions using lower level API `bus_multi_send` and\n`bus_multi_receive_batch_lookup_permutation`, uses higher level `linker\n~>` and `linker ->` syntax in proper machine and submachine structures.\n\nNote that we cannot call into the same machine using both lookup and\npermutation. This test calls lookup into one sub machine and permutation\ninto another sub machine.",
          "timestamp": "2025-02-17T14:13:49Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/powdr-labs/powdr/commit/7f066187febacd893acfb93fcb848f613bb0557a"
