          "id": "0569c3f13709fbdb974af76af4e58e501a750c60",
          "message": "Full FE in memory word (#2472)\n\nThis helps making successive Poseidon2GL calls cheaper (e.g. in merkle\ntree and sponge).\n\nMy plan for follow-up PRs:\n- use Poseidon2GL in the bootloader, hopefully making its trace smaller;\n- remove all variants of PoseidonGL, as it would have been superseded;\n- make another patch to the plonky3 verifier, so it benefits from this\nchange (instead of suffering a regression).",
          "timestamp": "2025-02-28T14:48:10Z",
