          "id": "74ff8cfe54a313d9b57fe3727fc35906d25fb9b4",
          "message": "riscv: support lifting for L[BH]U instructions (#2622)\n\nWhile running my program, I got an error saying that sbu wasn't\nsupported after auipc.\n\nThere is some code tasked to \"lift\" whatever instruction comes after\nauipc in order to merge all the immediate computations into a single\nimmediate. LBU is currently missing from it.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Ballet <3272758+gballet@users.noreply.github.com>",
