          "id": "59e10a2cd3d301a8ad0ca332245c291bb9a2e76f",
          "message": "Try to extract negation at end. (#2689)\n\nIn the conversion from QSE to algebraic expression, we always try to\npull negation to the outside in the hope that it cancels with something\nelse. It was not done at the very outside (at the constraint level)\nthough, where it can just be ignored.",
