          "id": "5dfedb0279b35af00b773c422723707ece1f89a7",
          "message": "Solve QSEs for expressions. (#2725)\n\nAdds routines to QSE that allow to solve them for variables or complex\n(affine) expressions.\n\nThese are essentially algebraic transformations that turn `constr = 0`\ninto `expr = result`, where `expr` is a variable or an expression.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Georg Wiese <georgwiese@gmail.com>",
