          "message": "Adapt to new metrics format (#3401)\n\nTwo changes:\n- The metrics file does not contain the `num_segments` metric anymore.\nInstead, we take the maximum segment ID + 1.\n- Instead of `app_execute_time_ms`, there is now\n`execute_preflight_time_ms` and `execute_metered_time_ms`",
