          "id": "0649ab135c05b02a99033d0cb78afab3f8602e0c",
          "message": "Support squaring of range constraints. (#3463)\n\nThe range constraint of `x * x` is \"tighter\" than the range constraint\nof `x * y` even if `x` and `y` have the same range constraints, since in\nsome cases, we can be sure that `x * x` is non-negative.",
