          "message": "Start reference IDs with 0 (#3546)\n\nI believe this magic number is a remain from hackier times. For example,\nwhen [allocating the `is_valid`\ncolumn](https://github.com/powdr-labs/powdr/blob/236b747ed9c01c41058850c4c9b40ae616d4d8ab/autoprecompiles/src/lib.rs#L605-L608),\nwe have a way to allocate a new column without leaving gaps in the\nIDs...",
