          "id": "82b45603e60b364e28a7c7b7a6ba679fc63f7d78",
          "message": "[Execution] Apc candidate tracker (#3500)\n\nIn the presence of many candidate apc blocks or superblocks, we need to\nchoose at execution time which ones to use in the proof.\n\nThis PR adds a tracker which runs alongside metered/preflight execution\nand redirects some of the execution to the apc tables/records if the apc\nrun is valid and doesn't conflict with higher priority candidates.",
