          "id": "e2101368a885f239f8442c92a0abe69f5029fb83",
          "message": "Nightly results analyzer script and job (#3551)\n\n99.9% vibe coded.\n\nI already reviewed it and changed some stuff manually.\n\nCreates a Python script that reads the latest 2 Nightly results and\ncompares the results of all guest benches and Reth. Outputs a report.\nAccepts different parameters like regression threshold and which\nspecific benchmarks to analyze (if not all).\n\n- The python script works, I tested it locally with different scenarios.\n- The workflow will be runnable only after we merge this PR I think.\n- Matrix bot will come in another PR.\n\nThe output looks cool!\n\n```console\npython3 scripts/analyze_nightly.py\nFetching results directories...\nComparing 2026-01-13-0902 (latest) vs 2026-01-12-0900 (previous)\nAnalyzing keccak...\nAnalyzing sha256...\nAnalyzing pairing...\nAnalyzing u256...\nAnalyzing matmul...\nAnalyzing ecc...\nAnalyzing ecrecover...\nAnalyzing reth...\n# Nightly Benchmark Comparison Report\n\n**Latest run:** 2026-01-13-0902\n**Previous run:** 2026-01-12-0900\n\n## Warnings\n\n- matmul: Best config changed from apc010/metrics.json to apc030/metrics.json\n- reth: Best config changed from reth/apc010.json to reth/apc030.json\n\n## Regressions\n\n| Benchmark | Latest (ms) | Previous (ms) | Change |\n|-----------|-------------|---------------|--------|\n| pairing | 13377 (manual/metrics.json) | 13218 (manual/metrics.json) | +1.2% |\n| ecrecover | 14910 (manual/metrics.json) | 14885 (manual/metrics.json) | +0.2% |\n| reth | 994364 (reth/apc030.json) | 966622 (reth/apc010.json) | +2.9% |\n\n## Improvements\n\n| Benchmark | Latest (ms) | Previous (ms) | Change |\n|-----------|-------------|---------------|--------|\n| keccak | 35616 (manual/metrics.json) | 35707 (manual/metrics.json) | -0.3% |\n| sha256 | 17081 (manual/metrics.json) | 17095 (manual/metrics.json) | -0.1% |\n| u256 | 61940 (apc030/metrics.json) | 62110 (apc030/metrics.json) | -0.3% |\n| matmul | 21032 (apc030/metrics.json) | 21239 (apc010/metrics.json) | -1.0% |\n| ecc | 13922 (manual/metrics.json) | 13989 (manual/metrics.json) | -0.5% |\n\n\nRegressions detected!\n```",
