          "message": "Batch constraint replacements (#3571)\n\nOptimize the performance of the rule-based constraint optimizer by\nbatching replacement actions instead of processing them individually.\n\nFixes https://github.com/powdr-labs/powdr/issues/3563\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: chriseth <9073706+chriseth@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: chriseth <chris@ethereum.org>\nCo-authored-by: chriseth <chriseth.github@gmail.com>",
