          "id": "703ed7c7b9eca3a648aaa92c538772a3c715bb72",
          "message": "Allow external PRs to run secret-dependent tests via pull_request_target (#3603)\n\nExternal PRs #3601 and #3578 are blocked by failing\n`test_apc_reth_compilation` and `test_apc_reth_app_proof` jobs that\nrequire `secrets.RPC_1`. GitHub Actions doesn't expose secrets to\n`pull_request` events from forks.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **New workflow** `.github/workflows/pr-tests-with-secrets.yml`\n- Uses `pull_request_target` event to enable secret access for external\nPRs\n- Explicitly checks out PR head: `ref: ${{\ngithub.event.pull_request.head.sha }}`\n  - Contains the two secret-dependent jobs\n  - Sets minimal permissions: `contents: read`\n\n- **Modified** `.github/workflows/pr-tests.yml`\n- Removed `test_apc_reth_compilation` and `test_apc_reth_app_proof` jobs\n  - Added comments referencing new workflow\n\n## Behavior\n\nExternal PRs will show \"Waiting for approval\" for the new workflow.\nAfter maintainer review and approval, tests run with access to secrets.\nTests execute using PR code with base repository secrets.\n\n## Security\n\nThe workflow intentionally checks out untrusted code to run tests. This\nis safe because:\n- GitHub requires maintainer approval before running for external\ncontributors\n- Workflow code itself is controlled (runs from base branch)\n- Only predefined build/test commands execute\n- Minimal token permissions enforced\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT TIPS -->\n---\n\n✨ Let Copilot coding agent [set things up for\nyou](https://github.com/powdr-labs/powdr/issues/new?title=✨+Set+up+Copilot+instructions&body=Configure%20instructions%20for%20this%20repository%20as%20documented%20in%20%5BBest%20practices%20for%20Copilot%20coding%20agent%20in%20your%20repository%5D%28https://gh.io/copilot-coding-agent-tips%29%2E%0A%0A%3COnboard%20this%20repo%3E&assignees=copilot)\n— coding agent works faster and does higher quality work when set up for\nyour repo.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: leonardoalt <504195+leonardoalt@users.noreply.github.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-11T12:54:34Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/powdr-labs/powdr/commit/703ed7c7b9eca3a648aaa92c538772a3c715bb72"
