          "id": "b219dc32acc705756236c1400f70cf26b00675d0",
          "message": "ci: skip GPU jobs on draft PRs (#3649)\n\n## Summary\n- Add `if: github.event.pull_request.draft != true` condition to\n`build_gpu` and `test_quick_gpu` jobs in `pr-tests.yml`\n- Add `ready_for_review` to PR event types so GPU jobs auto-trigger when\na draft PR is marked ready\n- CPU jobs remain unchanged\n\nSimilar to https://github.com/powdr-labs/womir-openvm/pull/297 but\napplied only to GPU jobs.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Verify GPU jobs are skipped when a draft PR is opened/updated\n- [x] Verify GPU jobs run when the PR is marked ready for review\n- [x] Verify CPU jobs still run on all PRs regardless of draft status\n- [x] Verify `merge_group`, `push` to main, and `workflow_dispatch`\ntriggers are unaffected\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-10T15:34:27Z",
