          "message": "Add combine command to basic_metrics.py and generate combined_metrics.json\n\nAdd a `combine` subcommand to basic_metrics.py that merges multiple\nmetrics JSON files into a single JSON keyed by run name. Update\nrun_guest_benches.sh and nightly CI reth benchmarks to generate\ncombined_metrics.json alongside existing outputs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
