          "id": "9d817e194c8eabaf3957b64d76caeb4b846ff679",
          "message": "Update `openvm` & `stark-backend` (#3678)\n\nUsing the changes of https://github.com/powdr-labs/stark-backend/pull/20\nand https://github.com/powdr-labs/openvm/pull/57.\n\nAs a concrete effect, this fixes the `metrics.json` for multiple APCs:\n`cargo run --bin powdr_openvm_riscv -r --features metrics prove\nguest-keccak --input 100 --autoprecompiles 5 --apc-candidates-dir\ncandidates --metrics keccak-metrics-new.json`\nGenerates [this\nfile](https://gist.github.com/georgwiese/728f39e13611c83336ecf2b3f1db2900).\nIf you search for `\"metric\": \"constraints\"`, you find that it contains\nseveral entries for AIRs names `PowdrAir<BabyBearParameters>`, but now\nhas an AIR ID field. As of our last nightly, there was only [one\n`PowdrAir`\nentry](https://github.com/powdr-labs/bench-results/blob/gh-pages/results/2026-03-20-0540/keccak/apc003/metrics.json#L4070).",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-22T10:35:36Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/powdr-labs/powdr/commit/9d817e194c8eabaf3957b64d76caeb4b846ff679"
