          "id": "0e2efc60511762ed5e55151b50b8acf1c9e53df4",
          "message": "Drop CI --emit-relocs step env now that openvm-eth's run.sh sets it\n\nopenvm-eth fab109a523fcd17302e1f573f1e2e3c30ccb0cbc adds\n`RUSTFLAGS=-C link-arg=--emit-relocs` to its `cargo openvm build`\ninvocation directly (and switches the guest's release profile to\n`strip = false`), so we no longer need the step-level env workaround\nin `Run reth benchmark` / `Run reth benchmark (GPU)`. Bump the\npatch-openvm-eth pin to that commit and drop the env blocks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-28T16:02:56Z",
