          "message": "nightly: drop POWDR_APC_CANDIDATES_DIR step env, bump openvm-eth pin\n\nopenvm-eth 2da45a23380154ee9e29b241b038d6f10cf0c828 sets\n`POWDR_APC_CANDIDATES_DIR=<repo>/apcs` by default inside run.sh, so\nlocal users and CI both get the candidates dump without extra plumbing\nin the workflow. Bump the patch-openvm-eth pin to that commit and drop\nthe env block we just added on the two `Run reth benchmark` steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
