          "id": "9ad8b1068fd2681954277bc34c66ad881b4e77ec",
          "message": "ci: publish_bench_results runs on partial success\n\nPublish whatever artifacts came through even if one of test_apc_guest\nor test_apc_reth failed, so we still push the surviving half to\nbench-results. Skip only if both failed or the run was cancelled.\nEach download is gated on its upstream's success so a missing\nartifact doesn't abort the publish.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-04T09:15:48Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/powdr-labs/powdr/commit/9ad8b1068fd2681954277bc34c66ad881b4e77ec"
