          "id": "726200c9d3f58730e7d7b39485446784f6b91aae",
          "message": "ci: TEMP disable test_apc_guest while iterating on merged test_apc_reth\n\nWe didn't change test_apc_guest in this PR; skip it during dispatches\nso we can iterate on the merged CPU+Modal test_apc_reth without\nwaiting for the (long) guest bench. publish_bench_results will still\nrun because its condition is `success_guest || success_reth`.\n\nRevert before merge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
